# Never let credentials or local state into the build context / image.
**/.env
**/cxone.env
**/.agent_state.json
scripts/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.skill
agent.log*

# Not needed at runtime (docs / spec / packaging artifacts).
references/
spec/
blueprints/
SKILL.md
README.md

# identity pool credentials — never bake into the image (delivered via env at launch)
cxone-identities.yaml
**/cxone-identities.yaml
